    "l2": "OVER 15 MOUNTAINS",
    "source": "NI WATER"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "It was built by hand, out of granite, between nineteen-oh-four and nineteen twenty-two.",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "caps": [
